# Source media kept beside the repo, never in it.
# Renders and brand originals: tens of megabytes that nothing in the app
# imports, and git history is permanent. Keeping them out means a clone and a
# Vercel build stay small. The files themselves stay on disk.
/marketing
/logo

# Supabase CLI local state (linked project ref, pooler URL, version cache).
# Machine-local and regenerated by `supabase link`; no secrets, but no business
# being shared between checkouts either.
supabase/.temp
